  "prefLabel": "Pod 502.07 Medication Assisted Treatment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 502.07 Medication Assisted Treatment. Licensees who prescribe medication assisted treatment shall adhere to the principles outlined in the “American Society of Addiction Medicine’s National Practice Guideline For the Use of Medications in the Treatment of Addiction Involving Opioid Use 2020 Focused Update”, found at https://sitefinitystorage.blob.core.windows.net/sitefinity-production-blobs/docs/default-source/guidelines/npg-jam-supplement.pdf?sfvrsn=a00a52c2_2 as cited in Appendix II.\n\nSource. #12149, eff 3-25-17; ss by #14616, eff 7-1-26, EXPIRES: 7-1-36\n\nAPPENDIX I\n\nAPPENDIX II\n\nRule | Reference | Obtain at:\n\nPod 501.01 | The American Podiatric Medical Association Inc., Code of Ethics March 2022 | No cost to download from: https://www.apma.org/apmamain/document-server/?cfp=/apmamain/assets/file/public/about/code-of-ethics.pdf\n\nPod 502.07 | The American Society of Addiction Medicine’s “National Practice Guideline For the Use of Medications in the Treatment of Addiction Involving Opioid Use, 2020 Focused Update ” | No cost to download from: https://sitefinitystorage.blob.core.windows.net/sitefinity-production-blobs/docs/default-source/guidelines/npg-jam-supplement.pdf?sfvrsn=a00a52c2_2",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pod100-500.html"
